OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAfter a chilly start it will be
OL,6,Fa mainly dry and bright day with best
OL,7,Fof the sunny spells over Fife and
OL,8,FStirling. Just the odd light shower
OL,9,Fwill develop during the afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FBright intervals and a few
OL,12,Fshowers during the evening. Showers
OL,13,Fwill die out overnight with some clear
OL,14,Fspells developing, these mainly in the
OL,15,Feast.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSunday:FA largely dry day with sunny
OL,18,Fspells and feeling quite warm. Cloud
OL,19,Fwill increase in the afternoon to
OL,20,Fbring the odd light shower.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
