OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FDry
OL,6,Fwith long sunny spells on Monday and
OL,7,Fbecoming a little warmer. Cooler and
OL,8,Fcloudier on Tuesday and Wednesday with
OL,9,Fsome showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
